{"version":1,"key":"card:356","content":{"id":356,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1ea6123d-e462-4819-8eb1-46a72cb7920d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数柯里化指的是函数处理一部分的参数，然后返回一个函数来处理剩余的参数，比如有一个加法函数如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"7bfc5da0-3305-4630-8d10-0de062e2748a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f2dfe50f-2ff3-4d44-a13a-e7ace7dcfb71","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function add(x, y) {\n    return x + y;\n}\nadd(1, 2); // 3","collabId":"c2565fa9-ee32-4995-a768-ae877914665d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bdbac1c3-8cb1-447b-b0b4-63949eb89e85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果这个函数被柯里化，那么可以如下使用"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"93ef2b84-f29a-41aa-b271-bdea45914d8d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"57194827-4c4a-4766-b223-9c1ac65376ac","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const increment = add(1); // 接收第一个参数，返回一个函数处理第二个参数\nincrement(2); // 3\nincrement(4); // 5","collabId":"d8b85424-a97d-44a5-b737-cdc412b8f03a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9d9cfec0-87a8-423d-a34c-7142790cc622","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"怎么实现这种效果呢，如果只是针对上面的加法函数，那么可以如下实现"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"8bc463ff-5642-472e-be1b-91d7bf98a3f8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"865905d3-f994-47ea-8eb5-a20a8a9532da","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function add(x, y) {\n  return function(y) {\n    return x + y;\n  }\n}","collabId":"9db62bab-aa8c-4930-9cb9-912ad20d8a93","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"57fa7a71-c0c6-4498-84c9-bdca9c92218e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是这种方法明显只对加法函数有效，我们现在是想设计一个函数，它接收一个函数为参数，作用就是把这个函数柯里化，并将这个柯里化的函数返回，比如"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"8a5becc6-bf47-48c4-9727-2efd63380154","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cc8c8307-f0de-4d07-ae48-7dbea4f9f4d2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"curryAdd = curry(add); // 接收add函数，将函数add柯里化\nconst increment = curryAdd(1);\nincrement(2); // 3\nincrement(4); // 5","collabId":"e7baca83-2c1b-4730-80d9-c8411a157416","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"84a75626-57a5-4924-93ae-759d690c8f30","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先实现一个简单版本的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"ea252ca5-16bd-4b88-9826-7893888d5701","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5bf19554-f4ee-49ed-8d6b-ba461647c5de","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function curry(fn, ...args1) {\n  return function(...args2) {\n    fn(...args1, ...args2)\n  }\n}","collabId":"fd04d8d1-c7a1-4ade-a0b1-3f25ac221613","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"59970dd7-9b19-4f45-93b4-f3e97aa9e4e3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是这个函数明显有一个缺陷，那就是只能传入两次参数，怎么解决，我们判断传入的参数个数与函数定义时需要的参数个数，如果传入的参数个数小于需要的参数个数，那么就放回一个函数去处理剩余的参数"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"4684c879-0300-4685-ab03-4755ca6631b8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"df148585-7774-4a7a-be75-fa1b5f9a1a32","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function curry(fn, ...args1) {\n  if (fn.length == args1.length) {\n    return fn(...args1);\n  } else {\n    return function(...args2) {\n      return curry(fn, ...args1, ...args2)\n    }\n  }\n}","collabId":"9b6f8c23-4940-4cd2-8dc4-152a0a3ae622","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"b9878da3-c0c7-4b4d-b622-7539ee29ea5e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"ab8802e5-9580-43ac-9871-d6d49f35f6b3","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1ddf7e97-d891-4f16-85db-42368928d363","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a0d31145-aaf6-449a-ae38-d059c1147d2e","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://juejin.cn/post/6844903603266650125","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"0b996ab9-2060-4ed1-9c40-0eaec863bf37","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大佬，JavaScript 柯里化，了解一下？"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"992413f2-3390-432d-bf1d-5cfe0d268f52","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"54abd637-8cfb-4f44-aeb3-cd0b46c4c49f","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/mqyqingfeng/Blog/issues/42","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"bbbcafb6-c4cc-497a-ad00-048cb617928d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JavaScript专题之函数柯里化"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1697157080844,"updateTime":1791553056060,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791553056060}}